type: software
title: "FirstGreen: HPC-Inspired Parallelism Extraction and Scheduling for Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  A local-first runtime that extracts a bounded task DAG from a software-engineering goal and
  schedules isolated coding agents along its critical path to reduce time to verified delivery.
